From: Samsung A23 bring-up <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] releasetools: preserve symlinks in extracted non-A/B targets

Without Info-ZIP -y, packaging an extracted target-files directory follows
ROOT/d -> /sys/kernel/debug into the host debugfs and may fail with EFAULT.
Keep links as links, as Android target-files packaging expects.

Reviewed against Evolution-X/build cnb non_ab_ota.py Git blob
82efdb22ed11d3dcaad24228eaa725e31829f99f on 2026-10-15.

diff --git a/tools/releasetools/non_ab_ota.py b/tools/releasetools/non_ab_ota.py
--- a/tools/releasetools/non_ab_ota.py
+++ b/tools/releasetools/non_ab_ota.py
@@ -600,7 +600,7 @@ def GenerateNonAbOtaPackage(target_file, output_file, source_file=None):
       tmpfile = common.MakeTempFile(suffix=".zip")
       os.unlink(tmpfile)
       common.RunAndCheckOutput(
-          ["zip", tmpfile, "-r", ".", "-0"], cwd=target_file)
+          ["zip", tmpfile, "-r", "-y", ".", "-0"], cwd=target_file)
       assert zipfile.is_zipfile(tmpfile)
       target_file = tmpfile
 
